WEBVTT

00:01:58.184 --> 00:02:01.976
physicists discovered
the whole explanation,

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:06.025
expressed, as usual, in elegant symbols.

00:02:06.882 --> 00:02:09.315
But never mind the symbols.

00:02:09.339 --> 00:02:14.676
Think how many discoveries they represent.

00:02:14.700 --> 00:02:18.011
Nuclei and nuclear reactions, of course.

00:02:18.035 --> 00:02:20.017
But isotopes,

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.073
particles of electricity,

00:02:25.224 --> 00:02:26.766
antimatter,

00:02:28.920 --> 00:02:30.741
neutrinos,